      "widgets_values": [
        "Decontaminate Colors — remove the background colour that bleeds into a cut-out's soft edges (green screen, sky, a coloured wall).\n\nGive it the photo and a soft subject mask (Alpha Matte, or a refined mask as here). Edge pixels get the subject's own colour; solid subject and background are not touched. The Edge-Aware Refiner uses guide_mode = rgb, which also follows edges between colours of similar brightness."
      ]
    }
